## Point estimate correlations between LBA parameters and Cambridge Car Memory score/Cambridge Face Memory scores

To estimate the association between LBA parameters and car recognition ability, we computed the linear relationship between the median of the posterior distribution of each estimated parameters of interest and the car recognition ability scores centred (z-transformed).
These relationships can be seen in @fig-corr-point-estimates-supp. Correlations with the face recognition scores were added to facilitate comparisons between these correlations










